  "nodes": [
   {
    "id": "h4_00001",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     11
    ],
    "text": "[A1][/A1]NAME",
    "placeholders": {
     "A1": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_28_01\" id=\"tag_17_28_01\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "atexit — register a function to be called from .I exit () or after return from .I main ()",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_28_02\" id=\"tag_17_28_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdlib.h.html\">stdlib.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint atexit(void (*</tt><i>func</i><tt>)(void));<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_28_03\" id=\"tag_17_28_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]atexit[/I5]() function shall register the function pointed to by [I6]func[/I6], to be called without arguments from [A7][I8]exit[/I8]()[/A7], or after return from the initial call to [I9]main[/I9](), or on the last thread\ntermination. If the [A10][I11]exit[/I11]()[/A10] function is called, it is unspecified whether a call to the\n[I12]atexit[/I12]() function that does not happen before [A13][I14]exit[/I14]()[/A13] is called will succeed.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A7": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I8": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I9": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A10": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I11": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I12": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A13": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I14": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "At least 32 functions can be registered with [I15]atexit[/I15]().",
    "placeholders": {
     "I15": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00008",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A16][/A16]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A16": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_28_04\" id=\"tag_17_28_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I17]atexit[/I17]() shall return 0; otherwise, it shall return a non-zero value.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I17": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00010",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     27
    ],
    "text": "[A18][/A18]ERRORS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A18": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_28_05\" id=\"tag_17_28_05\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00011",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     29,
     1
    ],
    "text": "No errors are defined.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00012",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     35
    ],
    "text": "[A19][/A19]EXAMPLES",
    "placeholders": {
     "A19": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_28_06\" id=\"tag_17_28_06\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00013",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     37,
     1
    ],
    "text": "None.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00014",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     39
    ],
    "text": "[A20][/A20]APPLICATION USAGE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A20": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_28_07\" id=\"tag_17_28_07\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00015",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     1
    ],
    "text": "The [I21]atexit[/I21]() function registrations are distinct from the [A22][I23]at_quick_exit[/I23]()[/A22] registrations, so applications might need to call both registration\nfunctions with the same argument.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I21": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A22": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/at_quick_exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I23": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00016",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The functions registered by a call to [I24]atexit[/I24]() must return to ensure that all registered functions are called.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I24": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00017",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     5
    ],
    "text": "The application should call [A25][I26]sysconf[/I26]()[/A25] to obtain the value of {ATEXIT_MAX}, the\nnumber of functions that can be registered. There is no way for an application to tell how many functions have already been\nregistered with [I27]atexit[/I27]().",
    "placeholders": {
     "A25": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/sysconf.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I26": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I27": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00018",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     7
    ],
    "text": "Since the behavior is undefined if the [A28][I29]exit[/I29]()[/A28] function is called more than once,\nportable applications calling [I30]atexit[/I30]() must ensure that the [A31][I32]exit[/I32]()[/A31] function is\nnot called when the functions registered by the [I33]atexit[/I33]() function are called.",
    "placeholders": {
     "A28": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I29": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I30": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A31": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I32": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I33": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00019",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     41,
     9
    ],
    "text": "If a function registered by the [I34]atexit[/I34]() function is called and a portable application needs to stop further [A35][I36]exit[/I36]()[/A35] processing, it must call the [A37][I38]_exit[/I38]()[/A37]\nfunction or the [A39][I40]_Exit[/I40]()[/A39] function or one of the functions which cause abnormal process\ntermination.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I34": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A35": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I36": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A37": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/_exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I38": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A39": {
      "open": "<a href=\"../functions/_Exit.html\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I40": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
