    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Extensions beyond the ISO&nbsp;C standard are marked.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00031",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The DESCRIPTION is updated for alignment with the ISO/IEC&nbsp;9899:1999 standard.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00032",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     61,
     5
    ],
    "text": "IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1-2001/Cor&nbsp;2-2004, item XSH/TC2/D6/19 is applied, adding further clarification to the APPLICATION\nUSAGE section.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
